# Confidentiality boundary — sensitive content stays LOCAL, never pushed to the
# cloud repo. Only the sanitized coordination layer (handoff inboxes, state.md)
# is allowed through git. See PROTOCOL.md "Confidentiality boundary".

# Sensitive working content (full drafts, review notes, legal material)
.shared/review/
.shared/private/
*.local.md

# Codex/agent raw transcripts and smoke artifacts
*.smoketest.txt
**/codex_transcript*.txt

# OS / tooling noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
